                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 850 391 866 2153 866 2155 845 2151 817 1824 806 1822 806 1820 806 1790 815 1752 806 1750 806 1748 806 1638 815 1582 806 1580 806 1578 806 1576 806 1561 817 1171 808 1169 808 1110 817 1050 808 1048 808 970 819 943 809 941 809 939 809 670 819 611 809 609 809 607 809 580 819 549 809 547 809 545 809 543 809 541 809 526 821 389 821 391 850"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="man, to be a husband to his widow, a father to his small children. Then"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-127_l8" HPOS="389" VPOS="866" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="66" BASELINE="391 911 2157 907" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 911 391 923 606 932 607 932 779 923 843 932 845 932 847 932 890 923 2155 923 2157 907 2155 880 2114 866 2112 866 2110 866 2108 866 2077 878 2048 866 2046 866 2044 866 1787 878 1722 866 1720 866 1718 866 1672 878 1654 866 1652 866 1650 866 1586 866 1584 866 1481 878 1455 866 1453 866 1451 866 1403 876 1373 866 1371 866 1370 866 1256 880 1223 868 1221 868 1219 868 964 880 929 868 927 868 925 868 834 878 797 868 795 868 793 868 791 868 754 880 697 868 695 868 693 868 656 880 563 868 561 868 496 880 446 868 444 868 442 868 440 868 389 882 391 911"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="only might the feud be considered as wholly settled. They repeated the"/>
                    </TextLine>

